msgstr "De router van de fabric is bereikbaar"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:16
msgid ""
"The router may be down, or your endpoint is wrong — re-check your profile"
msgstr ""
"De router is mogelijk down, of je endpoint is verkeerd — controleer je "
"profiel opnieuw"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:17
